OL,3,ADeath toll from Nepal-Tibet flood jumps
OL,4,Ato at least 469 as fears of second
OL,5,Aflood put rescuers 'on edge'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA lake of rising water has formed near
OL,8,Fthe China-Nepal border and has prompted
OL,9,Ffears it could burst its banks, reports
OL,10,Fthe BBC's Laura Bicker in Beijing
OL,12,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,13,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,14,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,15,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,16,Fborder crossing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
